Package: ghostty
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: fluterains <327620583+fluterains@users.noreply.github.com>
Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Depends: libadwaita-1-0, libc6, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libharfbuzz0b, libonig5, libx11-6, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libvulkan1, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: python3-nautilus
Homepage: https://github.com/fluterains/ghostty
Description: Fast, feature-rich, GPU-based terminal emulator
 Ghostty is a modern terminal emulator with native GTK integration,
 tabs, splits, themes, shell integration, and GPU-accelerated rendering.
 .
 This is an unofficial custom build based on Ghostty 1.3.1. It adds direct
 JSON window layout loading on top of Patch1's spatial navigation fixes.

